ss="mb-[15px] hidden text-[20px] leading-[30px] font-normal text-ink-2 md:block">This free sheet contains 100 VC firms, with information about the countries, cities, stages, and industries they invest in, as well as their contact details.</p><div class="mb-[15px]"><form class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-4 min-[480px]:flex-row min-[480px]:items-stretch"><input type="email" required="" maxLength="256" autoComplete="email" placeholder="Enter your email" class="h-[55px] w-full min-w-0 p-[15px] max-[479px]:mb-[10px] max-[479px]:px-5 min-[480px]:flex-1 rounded-[5px] border-2 border-ink bg-paper text-[16px] font-normal text-[#333] outline-none placeholder:text-[#999]" name="Email" value=""/><button type="submit" class="w-full shrink-0 px-[30px] py-[17px] max-[479px]:px-[15px] min-[480px]:w-auto cursor-pointer rounded-[5px] bg-ink text-[16px] leading-5 font-bold text-paper hover:bg-light-black disabled:opacity-60">Get the Sheet →</button><div class="empty:hidden"></div><div class="h-0 w-0 min-[480px]:h-auto"><input type="hidden" name="lead-magnet" value="vc-firms"/></div></form></div></div><div class="mt-5 w-[200px] md:mt-0 md:w-1/4 md:px-[10px]"><img src="https://p9hrvc3hnid3jlgq.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/img/r/43b519ba-9153-43a0-9fce-8e0afbaed800-9911b67f-w550.webp" alt="VC Firm Lead Magnet" class="inline-block h-auto w-full shadow-[1px_1px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] min-[992px]:w-3/4"/></div></div></div></section><div class="site-container max-[479px]:px-[10px]!"><div class="lg:-mx-[10px] lg:flex"><article class="min-w-0 lg:w-2/3 lg:px-[10px]"><h1 class="mt-10 mb-5 text-[36px] leading-[42px] font-extrabold text-ink md:text-[48px] md:leading-[56px]">Top 10 Venture Capital Firms in Warsaw (2026)</h1><div class="mb-5 text-[14px] leading-5 font-normal text-ink-2 lg:mb-[50px]"><span class="text-[16px]">By </span><img src="https://p9hrvc3hnid3jlgq.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/img/r/60535308b53e426e3274aa9c_perfil-f4d7386a-b5fc2e35-w582.webp" alt="Nicolás Cerdeira" width="30" height="30" class="mr-[10px] ml-[5px] inline-block h-[30px] w-[30px] rounded-full object-cover align-middle"/><a class="text-[16px] font-bold text-ink underline" href="/author/nicolas-cerdeira">Nicolás Cerdeira</a><span class="text-[16px]"> | </span><span class="text-[16px]"><strong class="font-bold text-ink">Updated:</strong> <span class="inline-block">December 19, 2025</span></span><span class="text-[16px]"> | </span><a class="text-[16px] font-bold text-ink underline" href="/blog#vc-firms">VC Firms</a></div><div class="article-body"><p>Warsaw&#x27;s startup community is clearly on the rise, with a strong group of venture capital firms backing new ideas. These investors are writing checks and helping founders build their companies from the ground up.</p><p>You&#x27;ll find some very active funds here, like Inovo.vc with its portfolio of over 70 companies. Others, such as Flyer One Ventures, have also made dozens of investments in the region.</p><p>Below is our list of the best 10 VC firms in Warsaw.</p><h2 id="failorys-top-10-picks">Failory&#x27;s Top 10 Picks</h2>
<div data-rt-embed-type="true"><div class="failory-card failory-card-centered"><img alt="Flyer One Ventures Logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://p9hrvc3hnid3jlgq.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/img/r/d20e73ca-73c5-4b27-a4ff-d65874cb0e00-e206802f-w256.webp"/> <div class="failory-card-content"><h3 class="failory-card-title" id="1-flyer-one-ventures">1. <a href="https://flyerone.vc/?ref=failory" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Flyer One Ventures</a></h3> </div></div></div><p>Flyer One Ventures backs early-stage startups from Central and Eastern Europe across sectors like SaaS, Health Tech, and AI/ML. With expertise from the teams behind BetterMe and Genesis Tech, the firm provides hands-on support in marketing, product, and recruiting to help founders build global companies.</p><div data-rt-embed-type="true"><table class="info-table" role="table" aria-label="Company details"><tbody><tr><td class="label">Year Founded</td><td class="value">2018</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Founders</td><td class="value">Vitaly Laptenok </td></tr><tr><td class="label">Investment Stage</td><td class="value">Early Stage, Seed</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Nº of Investments</td><td class="value">69 (15 as Lead Investor)</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Nº of Exits</td><td class="value">5</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Contact</td><td class="value"><a href="mailto:go@flyerone.vc">go@flyerone.vc</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div data-rt-embed-type="true"><div class="failory-card failory-card-centered"><img alt="Expeditions Fund Logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://p9hrvc3hnid3jlgq.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/logos/ff559152-17ac-48ae-38e5-80f3ae17de00.jpg"/> <div class="failory-card-content"><h3 class="failory-card-title" id="2-expeditions-fund">2. <a href="https://expeditionsfund.com/?ref=failory" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Expeditions Fund</a></h3> </div></div></div><p>Expeditions Fund invests globally in early-stage, mission-driven technology founders with a long-term, patient approach. Having evolved from a family office, the fund now supports a portfolio that includes breakout companies like Ramp and ElevenLabs.</p><div data-rt-embed-type="true"><table class="info-table" role="table" aria-label="Company details"><tbody><tr><td class="label">Year Founded</td><td class="value">2021</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Founders</td><td class="value">Mikolaj Firlej, Samuel Burrell, Stanislaw Kastory </td></tr><tr><td class="label">Investment Stage</td><td class="value">Early Stage, Seed</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Nº of Investments</td><td class="value">31 (6 as Lead Investor)</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Nº of Exits</td><td class="value">5</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Contact</td><td class="value"><a href="mailto:info@expeditionsfund.com">info@expeditionsfund.com</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div data-rt-embed-type="true"><div class="failory-card failory-card-centered"><img alt="Movens Capital Logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://p9hrvc3hnid3jlgq.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/img/r/00ea9056-9346-497b-8270-365e27ceac00-0d6da988-w256.webp"/> <div class="failory-card-content"><h3 class="failory-card-title" id="3-movens-capital">3. <a href="https://www.movenscapital.com/?ref=failory" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Movens Capital</a></h3> </div></div></div><p>Movens Capital supports early-stage European tech companies with a preference for SaaS and marketplace models, investing from seed to Series A rounds. They focus on industries including fintech, deep-tech, and martech, and have backed companies like Talkie.ai and Vue Storefront.</p><div data-rt-embed-type="true"><table class="info-table" role="table" aria-label="Company details"><tbody><tr><td class="label">Year Founded</td><td class="value">2018</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Founders</td><td class="value">Artur Banach, Michał Olszewski, Przemyslaw Jurgiel-Zyla </td></tr><tr><td class="label">Total Funding</td><td class="value">€12.7M</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Average Check Size</td><td class="value">€1M</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Industries</td><td class="value">AI &amp; ML, Fintech, SaaS, Marketplace, Industrial, Deep Tech &amp; Hard Science, Consumer</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Investment Stage</td><td class="value">Early Stage, Seed, Series A</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Nº of Investments</td><td class="value">35 (16 as Lead Investor)</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Nº of Exits</td><td class="value">1</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Top Portfolio Startups</td><td class="value">Talkie.ai, Vue Storefront, Sky Engine</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Contact</td><td class="value"><a href="mailto:info@movenscapital.com">info@movenscapital.com</a> / <a href="tel:9512408364">9512408364</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div data-rt-embed-type="true"><div class="failory-card failory-card-centered"><img alt="Inovo.vc Logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://p9hrvc3hnid3jlgq.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/img/r/3dd41f69-15d4-42a7-2b60-90de69c59c00-89d4571f-w256.webp"/> <div class="failory-card-content"><h3 class="failory-card-title" id="4-inovovc">4. <a href="https://inovo.vc/?ref=failory" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Inovo.vc</a></h3> </div></div></div><p>Inovo.vc invests up to €4M in early-stage startups from Central and Eastern Europe, supporting them from anywhere in the world. They were early investors in breakout companies like Booksy, Preply, and Spacelift, helping them secure over €500M in follow-on funding from top-tier firms.</p><div data-rt-embed-type="true"><table class="info-table" role="table" aria-label="Company details"><tbody><tr><td class="label">Year Founded</td><td class="value">2012</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Founders</td><td class="value">Tomasz Swieboda </td></tr><tr><td class="label">Total Funding</td><td class="value">€54M</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Average Check Size</td><td class="value">€4M</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Industries</td><td class="value">Developer Tools, AI &amp; ML, Deep Tech &amp; Hard Science, Healthcare, SaaS, Enterprise</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Investment Stage</td><td class="value">Early Stage, Seed</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Nº of Investments</td><td class="value">75 (36 as Lead Investor)</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Nº of Exits</td><td class="value">5 (2 IPO&#x27;d)</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Top Portfolio Startups</td><td class="value">Booksy, Tidio, Zowie</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div data-rt-embed-type="true"><div class="failory-card failory-card-centered"><img alt="AIP Seed Logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://p9hrvc3hnid3jlgq.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/img/r/b97572bf-5382-4ae8-9e62-a23df1701f00-a48a6a91-w256.webp"/> <div class="failory-card-content"><h3 class="failory-card-title" id="5-aip-seed">5. <a href="https://www.aipseed.vc/?ref=failory" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">AIP Seed</a></h3> </div></div></div><p>AIP Seed backs early-stage technology companies from Poland and the Polish diaspora that are building transformative global products. Beyond capital, the fund offers founders comprehensive support through its Competence Hubs, providing strategic expertise in AI, marketing, and finance.</p><div data-rt-embed-type="true"><table class="info-table" role="table" aria-label="Company details"><tbody><tr><td class="label">Year Founded</td><td class="value">2009</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Founders</td><td class="value">Dariusz Żuk </td></tr><tr><td class="label">Investment Stage</td><td class="value">Early Stage, Seed</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Nº of Investments</td><td class="value">31 (22 as Lead Investor)</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Nº of Exits</td><td class="value">1</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Contact</td><td class="value"><a href="mailto:contact@aipseed.vc">contact@aipseed.vc</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div data-rt-embed-type="true"><div class="failory-card failory-card-centered"><img alt="Simpact Ventures Logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://p9hrvc3hnid3jlgq.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/logos/6ce15dd6-0baa-4fb9-8e07-2a20731db200.jpg"/> <div class="failory-card-content"><h3 class="failory-card-title" id="6-simpact-ventures">6. <a href="https://www.simpact.vc/?ref=failory" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Simpact Ventures</a></h3> </div></div></div><p>As Poland&#x27;s first impact investment venture capital fund, Simpact Ventures supports tech-driven startups that have both high business potential and a positive social or environmental impact. They empower founders to build companies that combine profit with purpose, helping them change the world for the better.</p><div data-rt-embed-type="true"><table class="info-table" role="table" aria-label="Company details"><tbody><tr><td class="label">Year Founded</td><td class="value">2017</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Founders</td><td class="value">Jacek Ostrowski, Krzysztof Grochowski, Wojciech Majewski </td></tr><tr><td class="label">Investment Stage</td><td class="value">Convertible Note, Early Stage, Seed</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Nº of Investments</td><td class="value">40 (30 as Lead Investor)</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Nº of Exits</td><td class="value">—</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Contact</td><td class="value"><a href="mailto:kontakt@simpact.vc">kontakt@simpact.vc</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div data-rt-embed-type="true"><div class="failory-card failory-card-centered"><img alt="Radix Ventures Logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://p9hrvc3hnid3jlgq.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/img/r/c3163dc5-fed9-4559-1c12-66567626f600-aa7baf69-w256.webp"/> <div class="failory-card-content"><h3 class="failory-card-title" id="7-radix-ventures">7. <a href="https://radix-vc.com/?ref=failory" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Radix Ventures</a></h3> </div></div></div><p>Radix Ventures champions deep tech founders across Central and Eastern Europe, providing capital from pre-seed to Series A. Their team of seasoned operators works closely with portfolio companies, offering direct support and expertise to help them scale.</p><div data-rt-embed-type="true"><table class="info-table" role="table" aria-label="Company details"><tbody><tr><td class="label">Year Founded</td><td class="value">2024</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Founders</td><td class="value">— </td></tr><tr><td class="label">Investment Stage</td><td class="value">—</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Nº of Investments</td><td class="value">4 (3 as Lead Investor)</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Nº of Exits</td><td class="value">1</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div data-rt-embed-type="true"><div class="failory-card failory-card-centered"><img alt="EEC Ventures Logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://p9hrvc3hnid3jlgq.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/img/r/9637ce4d-4fe7-4506-4506-adfba0f74000-0c2a606a-w256.webp"/> <div class="failory-card-content"><h3 class="failory-card-title" id="8-eec-ventures">8. <a href="https://eecventures.com/en/?ref=failory" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">EEC Ventures</a></h3> </div></div></div><p>EEC Ventures finances companies from early to growth stages specializing in utilities, energy, and sustainable materials. Their portfolio aims to create value by lowering environmental burdens and increasing resource efficiency, often through IT solutions like artificial intelligence and industrial cybersecurity.</p><div data-rt-embed-type="true"><table class="info-table" role="table" aria-label="Company details"><tbody><tr><td class="label">Year Founded</td><td class="value">2012</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Founders</td><td class="value">Konrad Sitnik, Michał Lasocki, Rafal Malecki, Voytek Siewierski </td></tr><tr><td class="label">Investment Stage</td><td class="value">Early Stage, Late Stage</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Nº of Investments</td><td class="value">18 (12 as Lead Investor)</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Nº of Exits</td><td class="value">—</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Contact</td><td class="value"><a href="mailto:contact@eecventures.com">contact@eecventures.com</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div data-rt-embed-type="true"><div class="failory-card failory-card-centered"><img alt="FundingBox Deep Tech Fund Logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://p9hrvc3hnid3jlgq.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/logos/68c5ac24-8507-44e3-95f5-519a3daf9000.jpg"/> <div class="failory-card-content"><h3 class="failory-card-title" id="9-fundingbox-deep-tech-fund">9. <a href="https://fundingbox.vc/?ref=failory" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">FundingBox Deep Tech Fund</a></h3> </div></div></div><p>FundingBox Deep Tech Fund provides capital to early-stage deep tech startups across Europe. As part of the wider FundingBox Group, they connect founders with one of the continent&#x27;s largest platforms for technological development and growth.</p><div data-rt-embed-type="true"><table class="info-table" role="table" aria-label="Company details"><tbody><tr><td class="label">Year Founded</td><td class="value">2020</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Founders</td><td class="value">Tomasz Mazuryk </td></tr><tr><td class="label">Investment Stage</td><td class="value">Early Stage</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Nº of Investments</td><td class="value">19 (5 as Lead Investor)</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Nº of Exits</td><td class="value">1</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Contact</td><td class="value"><a href="mailto:contact@fundingbox.vc">contact@fundingbox.vc</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
